ith questions she says at the XXXX minute mark that "" If you want to do the save plan you could do the save plan. '' If I didn't know I qualified they I would have never got to this part of the conversation. They are not trained and do not know what they are saying. I have had other calls where I asked for amortization schedules because I felt the interest was not being calculated correctly. In that call the servicers employee did not know what an amortization schedule was and never sent me one. 

