9450922,2024-07-09,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage,Confusing or misleading advertising or marketing,"For context, we must go back to the beginning of our mortgage with XXXX XXXX XXXX around the year XXXX. We had taken out a mortgage and a second mortgage simultaneously that we later learned was a predator loan due to our home at that time being appraised around {$100000.00} and the first and second mortgage totaled around {$170000.00}. 

