9480312,2024-07-12,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I am writing to express my concerns regarding the practices and adherence to regulations and laws by the credit reporting agencies. Upon reviewing my credit reports, I have identified several alarming issues that require your immediate attention and clarification. 

